OL,5,     GKathryn Tickell invites the Irish
OL,6,     Gvocal group Landless to paint a
OL,7,     Gsonic portrait of Dublin in three
OL,8,     Gtracks; and plays Congolese
OL,9,     Grumba, Catalan songs, and Greek-
